     154   00:4033  CD 4E 4C                    call    UpdateObjectAnimation
     155   00:4036  CD 44 40                    call    ReadControls
     156   00:4039  CD 91 40                    call    UpdateFlipperAnimations
     157   00:403C  CD 39 41                    call    StepBall
     158   00:403F  CD E7 40                    call    UpdateBallAnimation
     159   00:4042  18 EB                       jr      MainLoop
