     399   00:4182                              ; Four smaller movement steps prevent fast balls crossing thin objects
     400   00:4182                              ; between two collision tests. Gravity is still applied once per frame.
     401   00:4182                              ; ScaleSubstepDelta returns one quarter velocity, so the four calls
     402   00:4182                              ; together integrate one complete physics frame without tunnelling.
