     457   00:41F0                              ; Collision order is deliberate: static geometry first, authored Tiled
     458   00:41F0                              ; objects second, moving flippers last. A tube hit takes ownership and
     459   00:41F0                              ; aborts the remaining checks. A drain reset does the same.
