     591   00:42BA                      .movingUp:
     592   00:42BA                              ; Curved/diagonal ceilings are touched by a top corner before the
     593   00:42BA                              ; centre reaches a flat ceiling. This lets the launcher curve turn
     594   00:42BA                              ; upward velocity into a strong horizontal component.
