     809   00:43F8                      ; Tiled object collisions
     810   00:43F8                      ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
     811   00:43F8                      ;
     812   00:43F8                      ; Objects live separately from the static collision tiles. The build script
     813   00:43F8                      ; reads ellipses and polygons from the PinballObjects layer and emits compact
     814   00:43F8                      ; records. This allows differently sized objects without adding tile types.
     815   00:43F8                      ;
     816   00:43F8                      ; Polygon bumpers are compiled to small per-pixel fields. Each four-bit value
     817   00:43F8                      ; contains normal+1; zero means no physical contact. Two pixels share a byte.
     818   00:43F8                      CheckMapPolygons:
     819   00:43F8                              ; Byte zero is the object count. IX starts at the first variable-size
     820   00:43F8                              ; record; its leading size word is used to advance to the next record.
     821   00:43F8  CD EF 44                    call    MaybeRearmLastPolygon
