     837   00:4417                              ; The expanded fields of nearby objects may overlap (for example the
     838   00:4417                              ; new upper-left flipper and bumper1). Claim the current substep so a
     839   00:4417                              ; second collider cannot immediately undo this bumper's response.
     840   00:4417  3E 01                       ld      a,1
     841   00:4419  32 3F C0                    ld      (OBJECT_CONTACT),a
     842   00:441C                              ; Polygon fields already include the seven-pixel ball radius. The field
     843   00:441C                              ; therefore answers a ball-centre query directly and supplies a normal.
     844   00:441C  CD EC 46                    call    SeparateCircleOnePixel
