     860   00:443A  B7                          or      a
     861   00:443B  28 44                       jr      z,.passive
     862   00:443D  3A 09 C0                    ld      a,(BUMPER_LOCK)
     863   00:4440  B7                          or      a
     864   00:4441  20 3E                       jr      nz,.passive
