     875   00:4455                              ; Kick property 1/2/3+ maps to 2/3/4 internal pixels per frame. Keeping
     876   00:4455                              ; this mapping here makes Tiled properties simple integer values.
     877   00:4455  CD 43 47                    call    PassiveCircleResponse
     878   00:4458  DD 7E 07                    ld      a,(ix+7)
