     973   00:44EF                      MaybeRearmLastPolygon:
     974   00:44EF                              ; A fired bumper is latched until the ball has genuinely left it. This
     975   00:44EF                              ; avoids another kick when position correction leaves a one-pixel overlap.
     976   00:44EF  3A 1F C0                    ld      a,(LAST_BUMPER_KIND)
     977   00:44F2  FE 02                       cp      2
     978   00:44F4  C0                          ret     nz
