     980   00:44F9                              ; Keep the latch inside the field bounding box plus four pixels. The
     981   00:44F9                              ; exact collision remains polygon-shaped; only rearming is rectangular.
     982   00:44F9  3A 01 C0                    ld      a,(BALL_X+1)
