    1225   00:469C                      ; Choose the nearest of eight outward normals. BALL_SIDE is clockwise:
    1226   00:469C                      ; 0=right, 1=down-right, 2=down, 3=down-left, 4=left, 5=up-left,
    1227   00:469C                      ; 6=up, 7=up-right. A 2:1 boundary keeps shallow contacts on an axis.
    1228   00:469C                      SelectCircleNormal:
