    2054   00:4BE4                      ; The tilemap ends at Y=191. Anything continuing below the flippers reaches
    2055   00:4BE4                      ; the shared drain line; static lower guides now come from collision tiles.
    2056   00:4BE4                      CheckLowerTable:
