    2211   00:4CF3                      ; Polygon normal fields compress very well but can grow when the map gains
    2212   00:4CF3                      ; objects. Keeping the packed stream in cartridge page 1 and expanding it into
    2213   00:4CF3                      ; the now-free page-2 RAM avoids silently reading FFh beyond address 7FFFh.
