    2219   00:4CFC                      ; Pletter v0.5c depacker. Each 16 KiB bank is unpacked to the free RAM window
    2220   00:4CFC                      ; at 8000h-BFFFh and then copied to VRAM by UploadPlayfield.
    2221   00:4CFC                      UnpackPletterRAM:
    2222   00:4CFC                              ; Pletter combines literal bytes with backward copies. EXX keeps the
    2223   00:4CFC                              ; compressed source and decompressed destination in separate register
    2224   00:4CFC                              ; sets; IX selects the encoded offset mode and IY returns to the loop.
    2225   00:4CFC  DD E5                       push    ix
