    2528   00:4EB2                      InitialSAT:
    2529   00:4EB2                              ; SAT entries are Y, X, pattern, flags. Two entries draw the overlapping
    2530   00:4EB2                              ; colour planes; Y=216 terminates the hardware sprite list.
    2531   00:4EB2  00 00 00 00                 db      0,0,0,0               ; grey/white ball plane
    2532   00:4EB6  00 00 04 00                 db      0,0,4,0               ; black/white CC plane
