    2535   00:4EBE                      SpritePatterns:
    2536   00:4EBE                              ; 8 directions * 2 overlapping 16x16 planes. Each plane contains a left
    2537   00:4EBE                              ; and right 8-pixel pattern, hence 32 pattern bytes per plane/frame.
