    2539   00:50BE                      
    2540   00:50BE                      SpriteColors:
    2541   00:50BE                              ; Colour 41h enables colour-combine (CC). Where the black plane overlaps
    2542   00:50BE                              ; grey colour 14, the V9938 OR trick produces white as a third colour.
